            <div xml:id="m-d3e7d875-639a-44e2-8795-114601783454">
              <lg xml:id="m-b38ba23d-b911-4308-93ad-06ecafe2bd1a">
                <l xml:id="m-21f80cfd-5db8-4ac0-bf99-f65d2dc1ebf3" facs="#m-64ff558c-02cd-4442-b856-c17a409c000d" label="text-like">3rd Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-4da8bdb9-861a-4d8e-8d50-69734ee22b86" facs="#m-fd65cb0b-1e90-4908-8ef7-6c4f0c1e9294" label="ambiguous">824</l><l xml:id="m-386b1c19-7239-47d4-9da3-6c1e975d1583" facs="#m-077f56a7-d102-4dba-b186-063e356ff261" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-fa89848e-aab0-4b23-a187-574371ae7901" facs="#m-0d47a5df-7ab8-45ba-a2ab-98fc2345faf5" label="lyrics-like">«Is nobis, Dómine, mystériis con- mitigántes, discámus amâre caelé¬</l><l xml:id="m-42adee92-5602-450f-b510-e7094a74f261" facs="#m-55f9c63c-1b71-439e-aa3e-3728e325c468" label="lyrics-like">It ferátur, quo terréna desidéria! stia. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5534ad43-ff69-4f42-a65e-1e03685d9f74" facs="#m-ab786ccc-7848-48ba-aa0f-e037c0047582" label="text-like">2. Of Our Lady, p. 819. — 3 for the Church or for the Pope, p. 322.</l><l xml:id="m-89a1588f-bc5f-46e4-8c86-61a029957fb6" facs="#m-104dc61d-add8-4c76-835a-2b6861e386dd" label="text-like">Preface. Easter Sunday, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-a4f580c8-d869-47f3-85ff-3bd8b409f609" facs="#m-f363f4bf-3a3d-419e-b0b2-ecf14d66afb0" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-59c94065-7fa9-4f33-9095-93e446c61eed" facs="#m-050a43e2-ac15-4634-8c00-edbcf56e2b5d" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-e9096816-c66f-4377-8140-ecc4251cde2e" facs="#m-59799a22-612c-4441-9b57-b73d0eb991d5" label="lyrics-like"> O-dicum* et non vi-débi-tis me,</l><l xml:id="m-5e5cac0a-739c-443b-a87c-d3bae02d0357" facs="#m-0b9d5286-6bde-4b92-91ee-f0fc6336e4e5" label="lyrics-like">allelú¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-ca95f8b6-1f4d-4766-85b1-a0caf559d19c" facs="#m-eb00834d-80bf-4dbe-96b9-ab70ac406186" label="lyrics-like">i- terum mó- di- cum, et vi-débi-tis me, qui¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef5e0c26-1a27-4b55-bb9e-8cfcca77823c" facs="#m-3fb5eef5-eb19-413e-930d-ec1f06519596" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-6ba59863-1af1-4208-9484-e9bc7b19e11d" facs="#m-c26e1586-857d-448e-bcb7-190f1f7f0e1e" label="lyrics-like">vádo ad Pâtrem, allelú-ia, alle¬ lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-12f5e60f-2cf0-47fd-a03b-1930996c9a2d" facs="#m-59d45150-6227-4412-8e8d-bcf531ce36e9" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-352fe378-5117-440e-a60d-3cd7c170a03b" facs="#m-d6440a28-c026-4d4b-b8f2-21be84b02020" label="lyrics-like">YAcraménta quae súmpsimus,l et corporálibus tueántur auxiliis.</l><l xml:id="m-5160f40d-70cc-455e-9724-6c20c8602180" facs="#m-2e46f2f7-4ccb-4452-bfce-c8c125d390ae" label="lyrics-like">O quaésumus Dómine: et spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-57a2b7af-00a5-406a-bf80-f896d9a8b102" facs="#m-697e4c14-d74b-4c8a-a825-ac6cd98eaf01" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-42666a37-3f9d-4078-a034-c0e7b2092f45" facs="#m-30f13032-aa23-4dce-bc30-c50bf137037d" label="lyrics-like">tuálibus nos instáurent aliméntis;! stum.</l><l xml:id="m-f89e8e51-b6c6-4ab8-8027-52231040135c" facs="#m-cc6513fa-c2b0-4197-b1cc-971df129899f" label="text-like">2. Of our Lady, p. 819. — 3. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 828.</l><l xml:id="m-7c3c4505-1869-4d7e-b2c3-d9d6763dd960" facs="#m-ce6d3000-9823-4432-b924-abc344d63953" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-6f6f0759-baac-4081-9d01-457e4655cfc6" facs="#m-df4c6575-b3cb-4be4-a7a0-e80a1bd6c5a6" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-05c427dc-ead9-49e8-bcb4-84705c2f3674" facs="#m-41b07cc1-eb1f-4d8e-9aff-94ad053f09ad" label="ambiguous">1. Petr. 2.c.</l><l xml:id="m-814520b6-e230-414b-a89d-8cc06aefd0e3" facs="#m-ce4662b3-1391-4a35-a2b7-5a1db5187e48" label="lyrics-like">YUbjécti igitur estóte omni humá- dúcibus tamquam ab eo missis ad</l><l xml:id="m-cdaec69d-aea2-4cdd-9461-a08b86d0c238" facs="#m-99faa50f-da9d-48b6-8ade-51cb5ea0101d" label="lyrics-like">O nae creatúrae propter Deum: t lvindictam malefactórum, laudem</l><l xml:id="m-2e7022d4-01e2-4216-8517-8c3e2f80ae99" facs="#m-84a2d4bb-1c26-4ecd-a74b-2bc4a4f85363" label="lyrics-like">sive regi quasi praecellénti :=sive lvero bonórum.</l><l xml:id="m-69877ae3-278d-4d84-8bc6-ca93eb6a68fd" facs="#m-0208e415-ffdb-4e13-b9e6-c3ec9c27d514" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Surréxit Dóminus vere. D. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-b31645de-9f59-486f-8854-3604d480de26" facs="#m-231e7732-c1b0-4e02-b63d-941415e3f9d3" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-7879d106-36b2-47c6-b09c-1a7f1e046492" facs="#m-02b48278-7d93-442c-930a-a421b77b92d3" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-6bb99a0a-c88b-4e0c-98e8-98e8e30d4d49" facs="#m-d3661029-22d6-4163-8ad9-c7f9a7656d9b" label="ambiguous">r. Petr. 2. c.</l><l xml:id="m-4c779961-c229-4497-9e77-eba35d35f6cd" facs="#m-dab5f4df-8de0-459b-8432-2beb3ba90fe1" label="lyrics-like">(Ervi, súbditi estóte in omni ti-] lis. *Haec est enim grátia in Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed7fd204-e361-43fe-b2a2-62cbbfebb32d" facs="#m-dc07ee4c-d303-4e25-813b-5de617da07f4" label="lyrics-like">O móre dóminis, t non tantum sto Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-414c5537-6aff-4dc4-94a5-472491ed7f7a" facs="#m-cf1eb12c-ad0b-493b-bfbf-41700d6805e4" label="lyrics-like">bonis et modéstis, sed étiam dysco¬</l><l xml:id="m-e06050e3-1e84-4c92-bc5c-ddad24aa760c" facs="#m-5b6c85cc-aaa8-41fc-b77b-1d277e80aeec" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Gavísi sunt discipuli. p. 249.</l><l xml:id="m-756dcba0-237e-488f-a621-e33d9689075a" facs="#m-d2099659-373e-4079-9007-76abcc0d0253" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-41ebd609-5713-41d3-9675-8c525a57cc10" facs="#m-87ca76f7-e2d6-4a15-8cec-feab26856a37" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Allelúia. Psalms of the Sanday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-900fb13b-0697-4409-ae68-f4765187e74b" facs="#m-1bdcf720-bb76-4872-8426-bb863f56c33e" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-0e441cfb-3d36-4e98-a77b-1c4b7c2a6c7d" facs="#m-6185a6bb-204c-4e85-a75e-22722e2f8782" label="ambiguous">1. Petr. 2. c.</l><l xml:id="m-12ff52e3-7136-4931-a0db-09cd801dec96" facs="#m-f4d89cc8-1938-421f-8eff-5755e04e6782" label="lyrics-like">vAríssimi: Obsecro vos tamquam! nére vos a carnálibus desidériis,</l><l xml:id="m-1b369711-cc30-4aa7-9854-a797befa6005" facs="#m-bc746f6e-9089-497e-907e-4e9b37983c58" label="lyrics-like">L ádvenas et peregrínos, f absti-l quae militant advérsus ánimam.</l><l xml:id="m-167d52b5-f021-4a2c-ae3f-f5bda867cfb7" facs="#m-a5421360-a3a7-4b1f-9f15-4c02813042e5" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Ad régias Agni dápes. p. 812 or p. 814. V. Máne nobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-3e0412b4-f2bd-4341-9f2f-a689fd51f7a3" facs="#m-6d393ebd-1625-40fa-8685-03842fd98ad4" label="ambiguous">». 815.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
